{{- end }}
- you learn something the hard way that is not written down where you found it, such as a tool's quirk, how a system behaves, a setup step, or a test suite that silently skips. Save it to personal memory if it holds beyond this project{{ if .ProjectMemory }}, or to project memory if it is about this project{{ end }}.

When your partner tells you something, save it before you start the work it shapes. Following an instruction does not record it, and the next session will not have heard it.

